{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09520","headline":"越裳献白翟 · 孙昌胤","name":"越裳献白翟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣哲符休运，伊臯列上台。\n覃恩丹徼远，入贡素翬来。\n北阙欣初见，南枝顾未回。\n敛容残雪净，矫翼片云开。\n驯扰将无惧，翻飞幸莫猜。\n甘从上苑里，饮啄自裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙昌胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}